      { kind = "item", text = "Excavation Site: Wetlands (Alliance): Highland Hides needs Young Crocolisk Skins first, and Horrors in the Highland the Tramping Paws, Fire Taboo and Blisters on The Land chain. The routes no longer send you to pick them up before that, and the Dungeons tab shows the quests to do first." },
      { kind = "item", text = "Dungeon quests checked against the DungeonJournal addon's lists: 46 quests added to 17 dungeons (picked up in another zone's town, or taken and turned in inside), and 15 missing links in quest chains. Each one checked against QuestieDB first; the links QuestieDB contradicts were left out. Dire Maul, Scarlet Monastery and Stratholme quests whose wing is unknown show in the Dungeons tab but stay off the automatic route." },
